Subject: [PATCH] Build05 v4.1 ground: stronger island-top patches (warm sun
 side / cool shade side, dark rim band); wood on remaining slab edge strips

env_skycity.glb (env_sky_static_palette only): island top coplanar midpoint split of edges >1.2 m (581 faces),
808 verts recoloured (4.2 m patches, warm yellow-green sun side / cool blue-green shaded side, darker 1.1 m rim band);
31 remaining green slab edge/strip faces re-cut into wood planks; 33 olive patch faces on slabs -> wood colour.
21 slab faces near the city lie inside the 09 board frustum and were left unchanged.
glb.meta: palette triangleCount 23826 -> 24696. Occlusion fixture: only the skycity sha256 pin (6db1c0b4 -> 1727cfdb).
